@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@authToken = Bearer eyJhbGciOi...

### Consultar Mi Perfil Personal
GET {{baseUrl}}/personal-profile/me
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Actualizar Mi Perfil Personal
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/personal-profile/me
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "preferredName": "Alex",
  "birthDay": 15,
  "birthMonth": 8,
  "aboutMe": "Estudiante apasionado por la inteligencia artificial y el desarrollo de sistemas distribuidos."
}

### Listar Métodos de Contacto
GET {{baseUrl}}/personal-profile/contacts
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Agregar Método de Contacto
POST {{baseUrl}}/personal-profile/contacts
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "GITHUB",
  "label": "GitHub Personal",
  "value": "https://github.com/puma-developer",
  "visibility": "PUBLIC",
  "isPrimary": true
}

